On 2007-09-18, Eli wrote:
> Any advice on keeping the arch-lich tame? Doggie treats won't work, I know.

First of all: Treats are not for tameness (well, they _do_ have an effect,
but only because they're also just food), any food the pet will eat
increases tameness.

The bad news (as you probably) know is that Ls don't eat. So the tameness
will drop constantly whenever you're on another level (and on a few other
occasions). You can either be careful to always keep it by your side,
or just dump it in a level you won't visit anymore (top level of Sokoban,
eg) knowing that sooner or later a trapdoor or level teleport trap would
separate you.

